{"id":"poekhali","lemma":"поехали","pos":"intj","rank":429,"glosses":["Let's go!","Let's do it!"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/cc/Gagarin-Poyekhali.ogg/Gagarin-Poyekhali.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Куда бы вы поехали?","en":"Where would you go?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274860","words":[{"g":"where?"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null]},{"text":"Зачем вы туда поехали?","en":"What did you go there for?","words":[{"g":"why, what for"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Куда поехали твои друзья?","en":"Where did your friends go?","words":[{"g":"where?"},null,{"g":"your","l":"твой"},{"g":"close friend","l":"друг"}]},{"text":"Я хочу, чтобы вы поехали.","en":"I want you to go.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"that...should"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null]},{"text":"Поехали на такси.","en":"Let's go by taxi.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/681274","words":[null,{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"taxi"}]}]}